          "extracted_fact": "country-specific data-center, cloud, customer, and partner availability;",
          "excerpt": "# nvidia_market_entry_expansion_planning.md\n## Europe\n\nThe profile identifies Europe as a current market. **Europe is not one legal, electricity, procurement, or cloud-availability jurisdiction.** For every finding, name the country (and where necessary the EU/EEA or non-EU distinction), service region, customer type, and effective date.\n\nValidate:\n\n- country-specific data-center, cloud, customer, and partner availability;\n- power availability, grid connection queue, energy cost, water/cooling constraints, network connectivity, and facility delivery schedule;\n- data protection, cybersecurity, data location, procurement, and sector-specific requirements applicable to the customer and service;\n- applicable EU rules and their scope; do not assume a rule applies identically to every hardware vendor, cloud service, developer, or AI system;\n- local language, support coverage, distributor/system integrator capability, and deployment skills;\n- product/export authorization and destination eligibility for the exact product and end user.",
