ng platforms. NVIDIA Corporation was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, California.\nwww.nvidia.com\n42,000\nFull Time Employees\nJanuary 25\nFiscal Year Ends\nTechnology\nSector\nSemiconductors\nIndustry\nMore about NVIDIA Corporation\nRecent News\nView More\nAll\nNews\nEarnings Calls\nPress Releases\nSEC Filings\nView More\nPerformance Overview\nTrailing total returns as of 10/22/2026, which may include dividends or other distributions.\nBenchmark is\nS&P 500 (^GSPC)\n.\nYTD Return\nNVDA\n14.05%\nS&P 500 (^GSPC)\n11.95%\n1-Year Return\nNVDA\n17.99%\nS&P 500 (^GSPC)\n14.39%\n3-Year Return\nNVDA\n414.28%\nS&P 500 (^GSPC)\n81.42%\n5-Year Return\nNVDA\n837.89%\nS&P 500 (^GSPC)\n68.62%\nEarnings Trends\nView More\nEarnings Per Share\ngaap\nGAAP\nnongaap\nNormalized\ngaap\nGAAP\nnongaap\nNormalized\nRevenue vs. Earnings\nyearly\nAnnual\nquarterly\nQuarterly\nyearly\nAnnual\nquarterly\nQuarterly\nQ2 FY27\nRevenue\n96.22B\nEarnings\n59.69B\nProfit Margin\n62.03%\nQ3\nFY26\nQ4\nFY26\nQ1\nFY27\nQ2\nFY27\n0\n20B\n40B\n60B\n80B\n60.0%\n65.0%\n70.0%\nView More\nAnalyst Insights\nView More\nAnalyst Price Targets\n180.00\n328.72\nAverage\n212.21\nCurrent\n515.00\nHigh\nAnalyst Recommendations\nStrong Buy\nBuy\nHold\nUnderperform\nSell\nLatest Rating\nDate\n10/22/2026\nAnalyst\nNeedham\nRating Action\nReiterates\nRating\nBuy\nPrice Action\nMaintains\nPrice Target\n300 ->  300\nView More\nStatistics\nView More\nValuation Measures\nMarket Cap\nEnterprise Value\nTrailing P/E\nForward P/E\nPEG Ratio (5yr expected)\nPrice/Sales  (ttm)\nPrice/Book  (mrq)\nEnterprise Value/Revenue\nEnterprise Value/EBITDA\nFinancial Highlights\nProfitability and Income Statement\nProfit Margin\n63.66%\nReturn on Assets  (ttm)\n53.57%\nReturn on Equity  (ttm)\n117.21%\nRevenue  (ttm)\n302.97B\nNet Income Avi to Common  (ttm)\n192.88B\nDiluted EPS  (ttm)\n7.91\nBalance Sheet and Cash Flow\nTotal Cash  (mrq)\n62.47B\nTotal Debt/Equity  (mrq)\n16.97%\nLevered Free Cash Flow  (ttm)\n41