ook\nGermany Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nFrance Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nUK Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nAsia Pacific Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nJapan Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nChina Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nIndia Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nAustralia Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nSouth Korea Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nSaudi Arabia Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nLatin America Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nBrazil Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nMEA Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nSouth Africa Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nSaudi Arabia Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nUAE Artificial Intelligence Market Outlook\nU.S. artificial intelligence market highlights\nThe U.S. artificial intelligence market generated a revenue of USD 81,041.9 million in 2025 and is expected to reach USD 483,598.5 million by 2033.\nThe U.S. market is expected to grow at a CAGR of 24% from 2026 to 2033.\nIn terms of segment, services was the largest revenue generating solution in 2025.\nServices is the most lucrative solution segment registering the fastest growth during the forecast period.\nArtificial intelligence market data book summary\nMarket revenue in 2025\nUSD 81,041.9 million\nMarket revenue in 2033\nUSD 483,598.5 million\nGrowth rate\n24% (CAGR from 2026 to 2033)\nLargest segment\nServices\nFastest growing segment\nServices\nHistorical data\n2021 - 2024\nBase year\n2025\nForecast period\n2026 - 2033\nQuantitative units\nRevenue in USD million\nMarket segmentation\nHardware, Software, Services\nKey market players worldwide\nAdvanced Micro Devices Inc, AiCure, ARM Holdings PLC ADR, Baidu Inc ADR, Alphabet Inc Class A, International Business Machines Corp, Intel Corp, Microsoft Corp, NVIDIA Corp\nOther key industry trends\nIn terms of revenue, U.S. accounted for 20.7% of the global artificial intelligence market in 2025.\nCountry-wise, U.S. is expected to lead the global market in terms of revenue in 2033.\nIn North America, U.S. artificial intelligence market is projected to lead the regional market in terms of revenue in 2033.\nMexico is the fastest growing regional market in North America and is projected to reach USD 180,057.8 million by 2033.\nArtificial Intelligence is widely used in defense and military applications in the U.S. to improve capabilities, decision-making and address challenges in national security. In order to reduce risks to military personnel, the U.S. military actively develops and implements autonomous systems like UAVs, UGVs, and UUVs.\nThe adoption and development of autonomous vehicles in the U.S. are experiencing significant growth. As technology advancements continue and public awareness increases, autonomous vehicles become a focal point in the transportation industry.\nNatural Language Processing (NLP) has gained significant traction and advancement in the U.S. NLP is used in virtual assistants like Apple's Siri, Amazon's Alexa, and Google Assistant to enable users to communicate with their gadgets using natural language commands.\nKey Regions:\nU.S.\n,\nUK\n,\nJapan\n,\nBrazil\n,\nUAE\nSign up now\nNo credit card required*\nPublish Date:\nDec 15, 2025\nHorizon in a snapshot\n30K+ Global Market Reports\n120K+ Country Reports\n1.2M+ Market Statistics\n200K+ Company Profiles\nIndustry insights and more\nANALYST CALLBACK\nThree ways to get this data\nSubscribe to the databook, customize it, or ask a question.\nHorizon Databook\nUnlock every chart on this page and get dashboard access\nStatistics\n1.2M+\nacross all markets\nDatabooks\n30K+\nglobal,\n120K+\ncountry\nCompanies\n200K+\nprofiles\nExport\nPDF, Dashboard, XLS & PNG, licensed to cite\nStart free\n→\nCustomize it\nCustomize data as per your requirement\nAdd\nCountries, segments, years\nRecut\nTo your product definition\nExtend\nCompany-level detail\nOr\nA\nbespoke databook\nTurnaround\n5–10\nworking